[Page:Stage2Map]
PageContent=#INCLUDE(PageContent:Stage2Map)

[PageContent:Stage2Map]
<h3>Stage 2 Map</h3>

<p>Curvature/height/lanes/hazards/object streams for this stage live in a 128K bank. The Jump/Split target addresses embedded in this data are patched in by self-modifying code when the stage's bank is paged in; the pristine snapshot used to build this disassembly predates that patch, so only each stream's start section is decoded below and any Jump/Split target address shown is stale.</p>

<h4>Stage 2, curvature</h4>
#CALL(map_curvature($E28C,1,0))

<h4>Stage 2, height</h4>
#CALL(map_height($E2B0,1,0))

<h4>Stage 2, lanes</h4>
#CALL(map_lanes($E2E6,1,0))

<h4>Stage 2, hazards</h4>
